{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the galaxy to rescue Twinkle's debut concert's audience in a lowpoly, 90s anime styled, musical platforming adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/b2de03442defe284704ad1a048609def.poster.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/b2de03442defe284704ad1a048609def.webm?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/b2de03442defe284704ad1a048609def.mp4?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/fd623317fb649c6f05175d34d5d56094.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play each level to the beat of a song as enemies, platforms and items  all move following the beat, the melody or the drums. Uncover musical minigames or explore the personal story of an struggling (but never surrendering!) young aspirant singer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/59a7ab08f4fa21b4dec60bca1ae04550.poster.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/59a7ab08f4fa21b4dec60bca1ae04550.webm?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/59a7ab08f4fa21b4dec60bca1ae04550.mp4?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/1516199c6bdc3c257bfc15cf69b5cb1f.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore neon-and-pastel alien cities, travel on Twinkle's best friend and roadie Bav's space van, help the locals by completing missions, sample the local cuisine or shop around for useful gear or fashionable costumes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/eec4c7fce87756ba4f4f6cbe0fa2ae13.poster.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/eec4c7fce87756ba4f4f6cbe0fa2ae13.webm?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/eec4c7fce87756ba4f4f6cbe0fa2ae13.mp4?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/0140d35dd414b8b8f0c1b5c61ceb1c14.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional objectives in levels like finishing one try, time trials or finding the hidden CDs will grant you materials to craft power ups and tools. Find lots of secondary missions and hidden items in the open cities and return to previous areas once you've got new tools to reach new places!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/263057b7683b9703a31f5460a616fc25.poster.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/263057b7683b9703a31f5460a616fc25.webm?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/263057b7683b9703a31f5460a616fc25.mp4?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/18cecc4068579c26ef4163d30699dbc2.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Twinkle's and each character's narratives through completing missions and the 'hangout system', in a story that is all about what it feels trying to make it out in life as an artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/db0e1cbc1abcfa3056bd19b0855a3d23.poster.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/db0e1cbc1abcfa3056bd19b0855a3d23.webm?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/db0e1cbc1abcfa3056bd19b0855a3d23.mp4?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Twinkle catch the culprit and serve justice? Find out her footing in the harsh career of music? Which friends will you choose to make? Maybe even find your love in the midst of it all?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So be a star and help Twinkle and her friends save everyone beat after beat, song after song!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938440?t=1758646850","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/83772ae9d499b4e8d6d323d1cd0271395259507d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758646850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/1b61c7a0d9d872e93786bdc13cf45047b3500250/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758646850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/1b61c7a0d9d872e93786bdc13cf45047b3500250/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758646850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the galaxy to rescue Twinkle's debut concert's audience in a lowpoly, 90s anime styled, musical platforming adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/b2de03442defe284704ad1a048609def.poster.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/b2de03442defe284704ad1a048609def.webm?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/b2de03442defe284704ad1a048609def.mp4?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >