steam/apps/3938440/extras/eec4c7fce87756ba4f4f6cbe0fa2ae13.poster.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/eec4c7fce87756ba4f4f6cbe0fa2ae13.webm?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/eec4c7fce87756ba4f4f6cbe0fa2ae13.mp4?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/0140d35dd414b8b8f0c1b5c61ceb1c14.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional objectives in levels like finishing one try, time trials or finding the hidden CDs will grant you materials to craft power ups and tools. Find lots of secondary missions and hidden items in the open cities and return to previous areas once you've got new tools to reach new places!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/263057b7683b9703a31f5460a616fc25.poster.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/263057b7683b9703a31f5460a616fc25.webm?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/263057b7683b9703a31f5460a616fc25.mp4?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/18cecc4068579c26ef4163d30699dbc2.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Twinkle's and each character's narratives through completing missions and the 'hangout system', in a story that is all about what it feels trying to make it out in life as an artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/db0e1cbc1abcfa3056bd19b0855a3d23.poster.avif?t=1758646850\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/db0e1cbc1abcfa3056bd19b0855a3d23.webm?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/extras/db0e1cbc1abcfa3056bd19b0855a3d23.mp4?t=1758646850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Twinkle catch the culprit and serve justice? Find out her footing in the harsh career of music? Which friends will you choose to make? Maybe even find your love in the midst of it all?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So be a star and help Twinkle and her friends save everyone beat after beat, song after song!</h2>","developers":["Molegato"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938440/cfb1fb6632890dd7cbb265d1671038bd858d422a/header.jpg?t=1758646850","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Twinkle\u2019s Galactic Tour \u00a9 2025 Molegato. All rights reserved. Exclusively Licensed to Top Hat Studios, Inc.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3938440/